    "text": "<p>We know,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
